text/html,a627862c91c7090783987ab8a26f9cad88b52e33c4404ee7e616ad9a0f4d470b,retained prior type,0,"Section 5508.0 - Title 71 - STATE GOVERNMENT 71c5508s § 5508. Actuarial cost method. (a) Employer contribution rate on behalf of active members.-- For each fiscal year, the amount of the Commonwealth and other employer contributions on behalf of all active members shall be computed by the actuary as a percentage of the total compensation of all active members during the period for which the amount is determined and shall be so certified by the board. The actuarially required contribution rate on behalf of all active members shall consist of the employer normal contribution rate, as defined in ","{""bounded_link_count"": 0, ""bounded_visible_character_count"": 21090, ""html_title"": ""Section 5508.0 - Title 71 - STATE GOVERNMENT""}",27919,https://www.legis.state.pa.us/WU01/LI/LI/CT/HTM/71/00.055.008.000..HTM,EXTLOC-205cb105c8c9b9190ba3b66d,,police,html,200,pension_or_retirement_document,https://www.legis.state.pa.us/WU01/LI/LI/CT/HTM/71/00.055.008.000..HTM,high,0,0,False,RESCAND-dec7c73e82b95a46405de79e,,MECHEXP-2a08aa0c7f4d640212aa8143|MECHEXP-33a0b780a6c1f4bae3023226|MECHEXP-3cf90c1e0ede4e1dc2291fc8|MECHEXP-456ff83f30c5e20f4a54da75|MECHEXP-6494ad1b5e3d94292f38557e|MECHEXP-67f8f2f72315fc052f448b1a|MECHEXP-8fa0d39a3837607b41e53267|MECHEXP-915360e54dc74839d720a176|MECHEXP-96f8d701e5d3b9ae83410d7b|MECHEXP-9ec1d3b216701da82526dfef|MECHEXP-a24181e85ceca4c3631f6763|MECHEXP-a822dded878d8582ceeaa1e5|MECHEXP-e344b90eea237a9406c3f6b5|MECHEXP-eed5cfb217ddb7622c2082a0,ROOTCOMP-649b011b90dd70cf1dd78c64|ROOTCOMP-95adb48844c2b0cc36d8fc91|ROOTCOMP-9d4feaa2ff42b2abb1bcca35|ROOTCOMP-e5689877d44d5e13792db5d0,external_search_wave_002_exhaustive_residual,artifacts/local_retained_sources/whole_corpus_external_data_exhaustive_pipeline_2026-08-04/html/a627862c91c7090783987ab8a26f9cad88b52e33c4404ee7e616ad9a0f4d470b.html,www.legis.state.pa.us,Conewago,0,true,00.055.008.000..HTM,2024,benefits_an